<title>BELGIUM: KB rates Delhaize hold+, Food Lion buy.</title>
<headline>KB rates Delhaize hold+, Food Lion buy.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of research report -</p>
<p>Co name-----------Sector------Price------Broker-------------</p>
<p>Delhaize &quot;Le Lion&quot; retailing  2,000 *    KB Securities</p>
<p>COMMENT: Delhaize share fully valued on assumption dollar/Bfr to average 33.5 in 1997 and 1997 price/earnings of 19.7. However, accumulate &quot;hold +&quot; rating maintained as dollar forecast looking conservative. Delhaize U.S. unit Food Lion &quot;A&quot; and &quot;B&quot; shares multiples presently below industry and historical averages and should be bought.</p>
<p>Recommendation: hold+   Analyst: Pascale Weber</p>
<p>(*) Date of research report: 28/02/97</p>
<p> Estimates:   EPS	  pvs est   P/E     Net dividend</p>
<p> 1995	    73 BFR    n/a	 16.7	25 BFR</p>
<p> 1996	    87 BFR    n/a	 21.6	28 BFR</p>
<p> 1997	   102 BFR    n/a	 19.7	30 BFR</p>
<p> 1998	   109 BFR    n/a	 18.3	32 BFR</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
